                        "summary": "Reconciliation stopped at a verified compatibility blocker. Retained F-passive-spec blocked draft at C:/dev/cpp/bitloop-workspace/bitloop-gallery/projects/Substrate/docs/PASSIVE_SPEC.md and reproducible audit at C:/dev/cpp/bitloop-workspace/bitloop-gallery/projects/Substrate/tooling/check_passive_reconciliation.ps1. Sections 2 and 5 retain equations, thresholds, commands and observations; this is an audit, not an implementable frozen package. Used capabilities bitloop and simulation-health. No numerical laws, runtime code or dependencies changed; no physical simulation or performance validation was performed.",
