                "question": "Review review-a29470831a996b62289ceb577e68f12b against T-pilot's retained issues status: what explicit disposition or management recovery is needed to enable the existing T-loop human check? Distinguish the unrun detached-package check from a pilot defect, preserve physical non-validation, and route any host lifecycle repair to its owning project.",
