                            "reason": "The inspected source, oracle, build logs, both retained traces and WebP snapshot support all T-pilot criteria. The image visibly reports no physics, ticks = 8 and time = 1.000000 seconds, matching the traces. No required pilot work is missing; explicit task-scope acceptance resolves the issues-status blockage without changing the plan or bypassing T-loop.",
