                                    "reason": "Accept for T-pilot only. docs/DIAGNOSTIC_PILOT.md maps F-pilot to reproducible instructions, fixture, oracle and retained evidence with the actual local dependency/configuration limitations. Inspected build records and primary/replay traces support eight fixed 0.125-second updates ending at one second; the inspected WebP agrees. Supported result fields explicitly contain the requested inconclusive physical claim. Detached package compatibility belongs to later standalone qualification, not this wiring pilot. Unimplemented checkpoints and untested restart, interaction, production-mode, cross-hardware, performance and endurance behavior are outside this task. Management persistence/reload and the capability-context mismatch remain for the existing T-loop human check. This acceptance preserves the original report and establishes neither physics validity nor human approval; no checks were rerun."
                                }
