cs. Keep compact hot storage and reusable staging, with measured allocation/copy costs.\",\n      \"depends_on\": [\n        \"T-approve\",\n        \"T-reconcile\"\n      ],\n      \"execution_kind\": \"work\",\n      \"goal\": \"Provide a testable core lifecycle without simulation dependence on Bitloop Scene.\",\n      \"id\": \"T-world\",\n      \"input_artifacts\": [\n        \"F-passive-spec\"\n      ],\n      \"parent_id\": null,\n      \"plan_review\": null,\n      \"title\": \"Implement authoritative state and transactional advancement\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"acceptance_criteria\": [\n        \"F-mechanics maps production implementation and focused tests to the approved constitutive/contact laws.\",\n        \"Translation, rotation, shear, compression/recovery and contact tests quantify local deformation, paired reactions and numerical work across timestep/resolution comparisons.\",\n        \"Degenerate/inverted or unsupported contact cases fail without invalid commit or silent topology deletion.\"\n      ],\n      \"components\": [\n        \"C-mechanics\"\n      ],\n      \"context\": \"Implement F-mechanics-law under the reconciled schedule. Use capability simulation-health for degeneracy and energy diagnostics; keep durable validity checks in core.\",\n      \"depends_on\": [\n        \"T-world\",\n        \"T-design-mechanics\",\n        \"T-reconcile\"\n      ],\n      \"execution_kind\": \"work\",\n      \"goal\": \"Deliver tested passive tissue, fibers and stiff support mechanics.\",\n      \"id\": \"T-mechanics\",\n      \"input_artifacts\": [\n        \"F-world\",\n        \"F-mechanics-law\",\n        \"F-passive-spec\"\n      ],\n      \"parent_id\": null,\n      \"plan_review\": null,\n      \"title\": \"Implement structural mechanics and contact references\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"acceptance_criteria\": [\n        \"F-contents implements geometry-based pressure, inventory, mass/inertia and paired wall-work interfaces.\",\n        \"Worked l