nce campaign.\",\n      \"id\": \"T-design-active\",\n      \"input_artifacts\": [\n        \"F-transport-law\",\n        \"F-passive\"\n      ],\n      \"parent_id\": null,\n      \"plan_review\": null,\n      \"title\": \"Specify resource-limited activity and active proof fixtures\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"acceptance_criteria\": [\n        \"Human agrees to F-active-spec's physical thresholds, supported quality, complete timing/memory definitions and justified endurance horizon.\",\n        \"Any changed requirement is explicit; failure cannot be repaired by silently reducing organism activity, feature size or quality.\"\n      ],\n      \"components\": [\n        \"C-biology\",\n        \"C-world\"\n      ],\n      \"context\": \"This approves test requirements, not successful behavior. Preserve the proposed one simulated second per wall-clock second laboratory target and record the actual reference hardware requirements.\",\n      \"depends_on\": [\n        \"T-design-active\"\n      ],\n      \"execution_kind\": \"human_decision\",\n      \"goal\": \"Freeze behavioral and performance thresholds before measuring candidates.\",\n      \"id\": \"T-approve-active\",\n      \"input_artifacts\": [\n        \"F-active-spec\"\n      ],\n      \"parent_id\": null,\n      \"plan_review\": null,\n      \"title\": \"Approve active and laboratory acceptance budgets\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"acceptance_criteria\": [\n        \"F-active implements local sensing, deterministic controller advancement, reaction accounting and actuator work requests.\",\n        \"Tests show fuel exhaustion limits contraction, replenishment restores it, elapsed-time updates are correct and unavailable fuel cannot be overspent.\",\n        \"Chemical expenditure, mechanical work, physical dissipation and numerical residual remain separately observable.\",\n        \"Scripted cyclic requests and deterministic controllers use the same physical interfaces.\"\n      ],\n      \"components\": [\n      