                            "context": "Proceed after favorable T-adoption review. Use snapshots-checkpoints and traces via .mindgraph/project_capabilities/snapshots-checkpoints.md, .mindgraph/project_capabilities/traces.md and .agents/skills/bitloop-development/references/checkpoints-snapshots.md and tracing-diagnostics.md. Generated checkpoint hooks are not assumed implemented. Serialize authoritative state, controller/RNG state, configuration identity and actual time; rebuild derived caches. No cross-hardware bitwise promise.",
