                "outcome": "keep_plan",
                "reason": "Inspected pilot source, oracle, documentation and retained build/trace records support lifecycle wiring only: both traces contain eight matching updates ending at 1 second, with no physical objects. The inconclusive physical claim is appropriate, not a failed numerical gate. Compatibility remains limited to the documented local framework; standalone qualification remains required by T-lab-qualify. Snapshot inspection is worker-reported; this review tool cannot open WebP. Proceed to the existing T-loop human check, including saved evidence and capability-context mismatch, not directly to implementation or physical adoption. No plan correction is warranted.",
