                            "summary": "F-pilot maps to docs/DIAGNOSTIC_PILOT.md for build/launch instructions, Substrate/Substrate.h and Substrate/Substrate.cpp for the development-only deterministic lifecycle fixture, tooling/check_pilot.ps1 for its oracle, and .codex/runs/run0003_20261009_130412/ for retained traces, inspected image, configuration, identities and observations.json. Used capabilities: bitloop, traces, snapshots-checkpoints. Added explicit scene IDs and tick/time telemetry without implementing physics. Actual workflow passed: 8 updates at 0.125 seconds, final time 1 second, exact replay, matching inspected snapshot. This one-second horizon establishes wiring only; no RNG is used. Prerequisites were the existing framework checkout, installed libraries, MSVC and working rendering support. Checkpoint hooks remain false; restart, interaction, physical endurance and performance are outside this pilot. MindGraph persistence, review and reload were not observed by this worker. Raw evidence is local and Git-ignored; decisive findings are also retained in the project document and this result.",
