                    "vision_summary": "Build and qualify Substrate's first coupled organism foundation, followed by an interactive 16-organism laboratory. Prove deformable structures, honest pressure-bearing compartments, moving-boundary fluid coupling, nutrient transfer and fuel-limited activity before expanding features. Hundreds-organism rich-world acceptance remains a subsequent, separately approved campaign."
