                        "summary": "One project-owned simulation state advances transactionally through explicit mechanical, compartment, field and biological exchanges. The inspected repository currently contains a generated Bitloop shell, empty semantic telemetry and checkpoint hooks returning false; no physical implementation or build compatibility is assumed. A passive coupled qualification precedes downstream biological work, and a resource-limited active proof precedes laboratory expansion."
