            "question": "Worker's concrete plan concern: Q3 and Q2 startup inertial-pressure ratios are 0.246740 and 0.012342 versus the proposed 0.01 limit; their acoustic crossing-time ratio is 0.316228 versus 0.1. Q4 retains speed/c=0.817015 versus 0.1, and the base no-slip passage predicts 12.5% flow error versus 2%. The current incompressible flow law cannot supply the missing sealed, volume-changing interior closure.",
            "raw_response": "{\n  \"base_revision\": 4,\n  \"outcome\": \"repair_task\",\n  \"reason\": \"The inspected audit identifies real fixture/model incompatibilities, but T-reconcile requires a proposed implementable package, not merely their discovery. Continue reconciliation by developing a quantified resolution for human approval; do not silently change fixtures, relax limits or substitute incompressible interiors. The current result cannot be accepted as complete.\",\n  \"evidence_ids\": [\n    \"evidence-5cb403c1-01d2-4cbb-8e7f-7806f208d138\"\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [],\n  \"task_actions\": [\n    {\n      \"task_id\": \"T-reconcile\",\n      \"action\": \"repair\",\n      \"reason\": \"Extend docs/PASSIVE_SPEC.md beyond the blocked audit. Develop an explicitly unapproved, quantified fixture/resolution amendment using the existing laws; evaluate all contents validity screens across complete prescribed cycles, and audit Q1/Q5 rather than assuming they pass. Preserve current failing configurations as counterexamples and retain all required positive physical behaviors. Specify the quality-matched passage configuration, refinement comparisons and complete-cost implications without claiming measured performance. Distinguish proposed amendments from unchanged authoritative inputs and identify every affected law/reference requiring synchronization after approval. Complete the coupled schedule, convergence/staging policy, budgets/horizons, failure-injection and weak-motion tests, and implementation/test locations required by this task. Keep the historical negative arithmetic checks separate from checks of the proposed package. If no coherent proposal is possible within the existing laws, record the bounded analysis and precise additional design or human tradeoff needed rather than inventing a compressible closure. T-approve remains the authority for changed fixtures and budgets; no implementation or adoption is authorized.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"follow_up\": null,\n  \"recovery\": null,\n  \"accepted_results\": []\n}",
