                "id": "chat-94b63679eb28058c389154b843368332",
                "note": "",
                "plan_revision": 4,
                "question": "could both be easily fixed just by tweaking a few values (smaller grid sizes and stuff), it would just run slower? It's not a true blocker, just a matter of \"performance VS quality\"?",
