                        "name": "Inspected F-contract draft 1.1, AGENTS.md, relevant Bitloop guidance and current source. Reviewed all three acceptance groups in docs/STATIONARY_FLOW_LAW.md: state/algorithm/failure rules, worked references, and disconnected-region/narrow-passage instrumentation.",
