                    {
                        "name": "PowerShell algebra checks passed: channel stencil residual 7.08e-16 N/m² below 1e-12; discrete driving power and viscous dissipation both 0.016796875 W; viscous-decay energy identity error 1.17e-18 J below 1e-14; two-cell pressure projection produced zero divergence and the expected 0.5 J numerical energy loss. Evidence: section 10.",
