                "plan_concern": "The selected no-slip stencil predicts 12.5% flow/work error and 6.25% pointwise velocity error in F-contract's 0.25 m passage at h=1/16 m. These exceed the proposed stationary gates of 2% and 0.5%. Adoption at that resolution requires review; no grid or budget change was applied.",
